---
import Content from "../components/Content.astro";
import Title from "../components/Title.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <Title>Support me!</Title>
    <Content>
        <p>There are a few ways to support me:</p>

        <h2>Contribute to Nekona</h2>
        <p>Contribute to more features, and bug fixes for Nekona, the upcoming replacement of Akabot!</p>
        <p><a href="https://git.lunya.pet/lunya/nekona">Contribute to Nekona</a></p>

        <details>
            <summary>I wanna improve the code of Akabot anyway (click to expand)</summary>
            <p>You can support me by contributing to the source code of Akabot</p>
            <p><a href="https://codeberg.org/Akabot/Akabot">Contribute to the Discord version of Akabot on Codeberg</a></p>
            <p><a href="https://codeberg.org/Akabot/akabot-website">Contribute to this website on Codeberg</a></p>
        </details>
        

        <h2>Financial support</h2>
        <p>Lunya accepts donations on Ko-fi :3</p>
        <p><a href="https://ko-fi.com/c4tgirl">Donate here</a></p>
    </Content>
</Layout>
